    {
      "name": "Service requests",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Open-request eligibility",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/open-request-eligibility?service_id=1&city_id=1&addon_ids[]=",
            "description": "Hint only (D65): {service_id, city_id, open_request_available}. Show the open option only when true and the place is event_location; creation re-checks."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests",
            "description": "Header Idempotency-Key (uuid) required. 201 created; same key + same body → 200 same request; same key + other body → 409 DUPLICATE_REQUEST. type direct|open (open: event_location only, no provider_id). event_location: exactly one of address_id / address (with pin); provider_location: no address (city = provider's). guests_count per service guest_count_mode. Errors: 422 OUT_OF_COVERAGE (direct), 422 NO_MATCHING_PROVIDERS (open, nothing created), 409 NOT_CONFIGURED (media_ids without requests.max_attachments). Slice 5a (approved contract revision 3): a direct request whose exact window overlaps one of the provider's active blocks → 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE, nothing created — also on a date that is not in the public unavailable_dates (partial-day block, D92). A replay of an already created request still returns 200; the same key after a 409 is a new attempt. Open requests are not checked (D84). A confirmed database deadlock is retried up to 3 times in fresh transactions (key re-checked each time); then 500 SERVER_ERROR, nothing created (D98); applies to direct and open requests alike, each attempt repeating the complete checks (D100).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"direct\",\n  \"provider_id\": 1,\n  \"service_id\": 1,\n  \"event_type_id\": 1,\n  \"execution_place\": \"event_location\",\n  \"event_date\": \"2026-12-05\",\n  \"start_time\": \"19:00\",\n  \"duration_minutes\": 180,\n  \"address_id\": null,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"city_id\": 1,\n    \"district\": \"Al Malqa\",\n    \"details\": \"Villa 12\",\n    \"lat\": 24.7136,\n    \"lng\": 46.6753,\n    \"label\": \"Home\"\n  },\n  \"guests_count\": 80,\n  \"addon_ids\": [],\n  \"notes\": \"\",\n  \"media_ids\": []\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE (direct, blocked time)",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Accept",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Accept-Language",
                    "value": "{{lang}}"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                    "value": "{{$guid}}"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests",
                "description": "Header Idempotency-Key (uuid) required. 201 created; same key + same body → 200 same request; same key + other body → 409 DUPLICATE_REQUEST. type direct|open (open: event_location only, no provider_id). event_location: exactly one of address_id / address (with pin); provider_location: no address (city = provider's). guests_count per service guest_count_mode. Errors: 422 OUT_OF_COVERAGE (direct), 422 NO_MATCHING_PROVIDERS (open, nothing created), 409 NOT_CONFIGURED (media_ids without requests.max_attachments). Slice 5a (approved contract revision 3): a direct request whose exact window overlaps one of the provider's active blocks → 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE, nothing created — also on a date that is not in the public unavailable_dates (partial-day block, D92). A replay of an already created request still returns 200; the same key after a 409 is a new attempt. Open requests are not checked (D84). A confirmed database deadlock is retried up to 3 times in fresh transactions (key re-checked each time); then 500 SERVER_ERROR, nothing created (D98); applies to direct and open requests alike, each attempt repeating the complete checks (D100).",
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"direct\",\n  \"provider_id\": 1,\n  \"service_id\": 1,\n  \"event_type_id\": 1,\n  \"execution_place\": \"event_location\",\n  \"event_date\": \"2026-12-05\",\n  \"start_time\": \"19:00\",\n  \"duration_minutes\": 180,\n  \"address_id\": null,\n  \"address\": {\n    \"city_id\": 1,\n    \"district\": \"Al Malqa\",\n    \"details\": \"Villa 12\",\n    \"lat\": 24.7136,\n    \"lng\": 46.6753,\n    \"label\": \"Home\"\n  },\n  \"guests_count\": 80,\n  \"addon_ids\": [],\n  \"notes\": \"\",\n  \"media_ids\": []\n}"
                }
              },
              "status": "Conflict",
              "code": 409,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"This provider is not available at the selected time. Please choose another date or time.\",\n  \"code\": \"SLOT_UNAVAILABLE\",\n  \"errors\": {}\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "List my requests",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests?filter[status]=&filter[type]=&sort=-created_at&per_page=15",
            "description": "Paginated. filter[status] one value or comma list. sort: created_at, -created_at, starts_at, -starts_at. Items omit address, notes, attachments, history."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Show request",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests/1",
            "description": "ClientRequestResource with address snapshot, notes, attachments (10-min signed URLs), history. provider is null for open requests. event_passed is display-only."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cancel request",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests/1/cancel",
            "description": "Reason optional (≤500). Only awaiting_offers / offers_received, else 409 INVALID_STATE. Recipients are closed.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Date changed\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Attachment URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests/1/attachments/1",
            "description": "Fresh signed URL: {id, name, mime, size, url, expires_at}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wallet",
      "description": "Wallet CRUD (D106, docs/wallet-contract.md). Informational only (D106): the balance is derived from ledger entries, is never spendable, and no deposit, withdrawal, transfer, payment or refund endpoint exists. Own wallet only — there are no wallet ids in the URL.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Show my wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/wallet",
            "description": "200. `data` is null when she has no active wallet (empty state), else the wallet. Example: {\"id\": 12, \"owner_type\": \"client\", \"label\": \"My wallet\", \"currency\": \"SAR\", \"status\": \"active\", \"status_label\": \"Active\", \"balance\": {\"amount\": \"0.00\", \"currency\": \"SAR\", \"is_spendable\": false, \"note\": \"For information only. This balance cannot be spent, withdrawn or used to pay for bookings.\"}, \"created_at\": \"2026-11-15T09:00:00Z\", \"updated_at\": \"2026-11-15T09:00:00Z\"}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create my wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/wallet",
            "description": "201 with the wallet. Body: `label` optional, ≤ 60 chars. `balance`/`amount`/`currency` are prohibited (422). 409 WALLET_EXISTS when she already has an active wallet.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"label\": \"My wallet\"}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rename my wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/wallet",
            "description": "200 with the wallet. `label` is the only editable information; null clears it. 404 when she has no active wallet.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"label\": \"Savings\"}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete my wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/wallet",
            "description": "200, `data: null`. Closes the wallet (status `closed`, kept as history, never hard-deleted); she may create a new one afterwards. 404 when none; 409 INVALID_STATE when it has ledger entries."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "description": "Slice 7 (docs/slice-7-contract.md). Participants only; every other account gets 404. Status `active`/`read_only` is computed from the request lifecycle (§3). No realtime; poll or refresh.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Open conversation",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "{{lang}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/client/service-requests/{{service_request_id}}/conversation",
            "description": "Get-or-create (idempotent, 200). Client: `provider_id` = the direct target, a provider who sent her a client-visible offer, or her booked provider; anyone else 404 (open-request recipients are never revealed, D56). 409 INVALID_STATE when no conversation exists yet and the pair is no longer active.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"provider_id\": 4}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List conversations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
