            "description": "Upload first with `POST shared/uploads` (context chat_image | chat_file | chat_voice; limits = `uploads.chat_*`, unset → 409 NOT_CONFIGURED). `media_id` must be her own unused upload of the matching context (422 otherwise). `body` = optional caption.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"client_uuid\": \"{{$guid}}\", \"type\": \"image\", \"media_id\": 55, \"body\": \"Our venue\"}"
            }
          }
        },
